## When adding a new feature

1. Confirm the Foundation Gate has passed before Requirements.
2. Create `docs/product/features/{feature}/PRD.md`.
3. Create `docs/product/features/{feature}/TRD.md`.
4. Add user stories under `docs/product/features/{feature}/stories/` as work progresses.
5. Add platform-level behavioral scenarios under `docs/product/features/{feature}/scenarios/` as acceptance criteria are defined.
6. Surface-specific scenarios and step definitions are created during implementation under the relevant app.

## Specification evolution

PRDs and TRDs are living documents — update in place and append to the changelog section (date, change, rationale). For evolution strategies per artifact type, consult the product-development methodology documentation (installed at `.agents/local-skills/product-development/docs/METHODOLOGY.md` or `.agents/skills/product-development/docs/METHODOLOGY.md`).
